Node ID=1 Conversation Start
Text=So, you seek to eliminate the goblin scourge? But it will be you that will be purged!
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=Goblin Horde IS
Reply Text=Look again before you swing. I carried word from Hrubjub to the Great Khan himself, and I am still carrying it.
