Node ID=10 recognised
Text=<He squints, and the spear comes down a hand's width.> The Khan's own chum, out here in the mud with the rest of us? Then hold a moment, chum, and hear a proposition from a goblin with a grudge.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=I am listening.
Go to node ID=20 the offer

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=I am nobody's errand boy, least of all a goblin's.
Go to node ID=90 goodbye
Icon=Exit Icon
Is Default Reply=1
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=20 the offer
Text=There is a guardsman at the crossroads, Esteban by name, in Templar colours and Templar wages. He does not fight us himself - oh no, he pays passing meat to do it, a coin a head, and we are the heads. Kill him, and this road is goblin road again.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=Outwit 7+
Reply Text=You have a patrol, spears and a scout, and you still need a human to do it. He is not the one you are afraid of - the Templars behind him are.
Go to node ID=25 seen through
Icon=Attribute Icon

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=Consider it done.
