Node ID=25 seen through
Text=<A long, unblinking pause.> ...Clever meat. Yes. Kill a guardsman with goblin spears and the white cloaks come in numbers. Kill him with a human hand and they come looking for a human. So: will you, or will you not?
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=I will. But I will be paid as a professional, not as meat.
